amaa ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਜੋ ਨਾ ਛਿਜਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਕਰਮਾ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈ,"}}},{"verse_id":102934,"page_no":654,"line_no":102934,"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਆਲੋਕ ਧਰਮਾ ॥","translit_en":"k aalok dharamaa ||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"His action and duties were illustrious and not liable to decay"},"pu":{"ss":"ਅਦੁੱਤੀ ਧਰਮ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈ,"}}},{"verse_id":102935,"page_no":654,"line_no":102935,"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਆਦੇਸ ਕਰਤਾ ॥","translit_en":"k aadhes karataa ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਆਦੇਸ਼ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈ,"}}},{"verse_id":102936,"page_no":654,"line_no":102936,"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸੰਨ੍ਯਾਸ ਸਰਤਾ ॥੨੩੭॥","translit_en":"k sa(n)nayaas sarataa ||237||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"He was the commander of all and was like a stream of Sannyas.237."},"pu":{"ss":"ਸੰਨਿਆਸ ਦਾ ਦਰਿਆ ਹੈ ॥੨੩੭॥"}}},{"verse_id":102937,"page_no":654,"line_no":102937,"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਅਗਿਆਨ ਹੰਤਾ ॥","translit_en":"k agiaan ha(n)taa ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਜੋ ਅਗਿਆਨ ਨੂੰ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈ,"}}},{"verse_id":102938,"page_no":654,"line_no":102938,"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਪਾਰੰਗ ਗੰਤਾ ॥","translit_en":"k paara(n)g ga(n)taa ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"(ਸੰਸਾਰ ਤੋਂ) ਪਾਰ ਦੀ ਜਾਣਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈ,"}}},{"verse_id":102939,"page_no":654,"line_no":102939,"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਆਧਰਮ ਹੰਤਾ ॥","translit_en":"k aadharam ha(n)taa ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਅਧਰਮ ਨੂੰ ਖ਼ਤਮ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈ"}}},{"verse_id":102940,"page_no":654,"line_no":102940,"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸੰਨ੍ਯਾਸ ਭਕਤਾ ॥੨੩੮॥","translit_en":"k sa(n)nayaas bhakataa ||238||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"He was the destroyer of ignorance, skilful in sciences, the destroyer of impiety and a devotee of Sannyasis.238."},"pu":{"ss":"ਅਤੇ ਸੰਨਿਆਸ ਦਾ ਭਗਤ ਹੈ ॥੨੩੮॥"}}},{"verse_id":102941,"page_no":654,"line_no":102941,"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਖੰਕਾਲ ਦਾਸੰ ॥","translit_en":"k kha(n)kaal dhaasa(n) ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਜੋ ਖੰਕਾਲ (ਭੈਰੋ) ਦਾ ਦਾਸ ਹੈ,"}}},{"verse_id":102942,"page_no":654,"line_no":102942,"gurmukhi":"ਕਿ ਸਰਬਤ੍ਰ ਭਾਸੰ ॥","translit_en":"k sarabatr bhaasa(n) ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਸਭ ਵਿਚ ਭਾਸਦਾ (ਪ੍ਰਤੀਤ ਹੁੰਦਾ) ਹੈ,"}}},{"verse_id":102943,"page_no":654,"line_no":1